<title>FRANCE: BOROTRA SAYS SUPPORTING RENAULT'S HEAD.</title>
<headline>BOROTRA SAYS SUPPORTING RENAULT'S HEAD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French industry minister Franck Borotra said he was supporting embattled Renault chairman Louis Schweitzer but said the chairman must assume responsibility for the restructuring plan of the car company.</p>
<p>&quot;The chairman of Renault takes responsibility for his decision,&quot; Borotra told Europe 1 radio. &quot;I am not abandoning Schweitzer nor the Renault company.&quot;</p>
</text>
